SimForge Dual License
=====================

Copyright (c) 2026 SimForge (@SimForgeYT).

This repository uses a dual-licensing structure common in game development and creative tech:
the underlying simulation engine and developer tools are open-source under the MIT License,
while the creative content, characters, episodes, storylines, and brand identity remain
fully protected.

