--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Creative Content, Characters, Episodes & Brand Assets (All Rights Reserved)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All original creative intellectual property, artistic works, storytelling scripts,
character models, and channel branding located in:
  - `src/episodes/` (storyline scripts, scene staging, kinematics, timing data)
  - `src/artifacts/` (character designs, adventurer rigs, diorama models, prop geometry)
  - `media/` (channel branding, logos, profile pictures, banners, demo videos)
  - `public/episodes/` (voiceover narration, audio stems, SFX, music)
  - `out/` (rendered videos, thumbnails, review contact sheets)
  - The name "SimForge", the handle "@SimForgeYT", and associated channel trademarks

are proprietary works. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.

Without express written permission from the copyright owner, you MAY NOT:
  1. Re-upload, distribute, broadcast, or monetize the generated video files, audio tracks,
     or storyline scripts on YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, or any other media platform.
  2. Use the character models, visual identities, or channel branding for commercial
     content creation or automated content generation channels.
  3. Claim ownership of or redistribute the creative storytelling assets as your own.

