3. Third-Party Licenses & Remotion
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project incorporates third-party libraries, notably Three.js (MIT) and Remotion.
Use of the Remotion video engine is subject to Remotion's license terms. Commercial
monetization of Remotion video output may require a commercial license from Remotion
(see https://remotion.dev/pricing).
